  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Thailand improve water security in the Eastern Economic Corridor</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The investment is providing advisory support and capacity building to the Eastern Economic Corridor Office (an area-based development initiative aiming to revitalise the Eastern Seaboard of the Gulf of Thailand) and to key Thai agencies on development of an Integrated Water Management strategy for the region, development of water balance scenario tool, and input to the design of a new Smart City.</narrative>
  </description>
